---
title: The first post
template: post
---

The `toc` and `page_data` plugins of this app write to `ctx.data`. This page
exports what they left as `plugin_data`, and the `post` template gets it as a
prop, which is where the list of headings and the reading time above come from.

## Reading the export

This page has <span class="words">{plugin_data.page.words}</span> words
and <span class="headings">{plugin_data.toc.headings.length}</span> headings.

## With `code` in a heading

The entry of a heading holds its text as a reader sees it.
